5. Face imagery
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
    This repository contains NO face images. The gallery and probe folders
    ship empty on purpose: the images used during development were
    third-party press photographs and photographs of identifiable people,
    and neither their copyright nor the consent of the people depicted
    permits redistribution.

    Supply your own images, and only images you have the right to use.
    See docs/dataset.md.

    The one face shown in docs/assets/ is the NASA portrait of astronaut
    Eileen Collins distributed with scikit-image as `skimage.data.astronaut()`.
    NASA imagery is in the public domain. The figures are regenerated by
    scripts/make_demo_assets.py, which pulls the image from scikit-image
    rather than storing a copy.

